  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"https://www.notion.so/7-1-27c834d1c7858025a854e1a51e944744?source=copy_link#2a6834d1c78580959abddf5a605effcc\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sustaining-soarer-984.notion.site/A_-_-27c834d1c78580828d7ad2274b4a7214?source=copy_link</a></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a71a183ac3dc4803810fa88e130e5c6b68d6ded0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a71a183ac3dc4803810fa88e130e5c6b68d6ded0\" data-origin-width=\"1458\" data-origin-height=\"624\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>학생들에게 링크 또는 qr코드 하나만 뿌리면 수업이 가능하다는 장점이 있습니다. 수업에 관한 자료들이 한 페이지에 수록된 곳입니다.&#160;</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>제작한 웹앱, 노트북 LM등을 삽입해두었습니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>아래 빨간 박스를 클릭하면 해당 단원으로 이동합니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4290775ec005524db8e853ee52957f0b44a9bdd0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4290775ec005524db8e853ee52957f0b44a9bdd0\" data-origin-width=\"1715\" data-origin-height=\"559\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05be7762b5233c41fd7aa4237b0c40374d168bfa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05be7762b5233c41fd7aa4237b0c40374d168bfa\" data-origin-width=\"941\" data-origin-height=\"695\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>차시별로 정리도 되어있습니다.&#160;&#160;</b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t